{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/5705e4905391eb3a21500223df193865.poster.avif?t=1761726096\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/5705e4905391eb3a21500223df193865.webm?t=1761726096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/5705e4905391eb3a21500223df193865.mp4?t=1761726096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Red Tether features explosive top-down space action with a unique &quot;indirect combat&quot; system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face massive space fleets and fierce oppositions, while being armed with nothing but tether-harpoons and your wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/12070cb14aac4c106b0865cdaffed6fc.poster.avif?t=1761726096\" width=600 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/12070cb14aac4c106b0865cdaffed6fc.webm?t=1761726096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/12070cb14aac4c106b0865cdaffed6fc.mp4?t=1761726096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight tether-based space battles that revolves entirely around linking yourself with opponents or them with each other. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash vessels into another using contracting tethers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rip off enemy weapons and attachments with well placed harpoons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outmaneuver the fleet by graple-swinging around objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your ship as a battering ram by slamming yourself into the opposition.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/e5f0ae8ae7221d46f0614556e5c03b6d.poster.avif?t=1761726096\" width=600 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/e5f0ae8ae7221d46f0614556e5c03b6d.webm?t=1761726096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/e5f0ae8ae7221d46f0614556e5c03b6d.mp4?t=1761726096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fresh &quot;combat-puzzle&quot; gameplay that requires split-second tactical decisions amid fast paced action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully consider how to use ships against another, when to disarm and when to destroy and how to utilize the changing battle environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to counter various fleet elements, including attack ships, support crafts and logistic units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through 50+ pre-made waves, or face randomly generated fleets in endless mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clash with 16+ massive boss enemies and turn them into screen-filling explosions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge clearly telegraphed enemy attacks and potentially turn them against your opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid or exploit various hazards like flammable fuel spills, electrified hulls, coolant clouds and magnetic fields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/1b838f6b1c01b468e2da3c54a4db6670.poster.avif?t=1761726096\" width=600 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/1b838f6b1c01b468e2da3c54a4db6670.webm?t=1761726096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/1b838f6b1c01b468e2da3c54a4db6670.mp4?t=1761726096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 18+ player ship variants that offer distinct playstyles, advantages and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your craft with 120+ stackable ship and tether upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch and collect 14 bio-mechanical fish to gain advanced tech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 10+ star system zones and the new enemies they throw at you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the game's lore by finding black boxes among all the ship-debris.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a tiny glimpse at a complex sci-fi universe. The story continues in Hyperspace Dogfights, Swirl W@tch and Hyperspace Deck Command. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable various challenge modes for the lategame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic controller support and assist options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/59466e93fe1ba8d7c0aff4a2cd20b985.poster.avif?t=1761726096\" width=480 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/59466e93fe1ba8d7c0aff4a2cd20b985.webm?t=1761726096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/59466e93fe1ba8d7c0aff4a2cd20b985.mp4?t=1761726096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1714080?t=1761726096","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761726096","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761726096","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761726096","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/5705e4905391eb3a21500223df193865.poster.avif?t=1761726096\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/5705e4905391eb3a21500223df193865.webm?t=1761726096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/5705e4905391eb3a21500223df193865.mp4?t=1761726096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Red Tether features explosive top-down space action with a unique &quot;indirect combat&quot; system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face massive space fleets and fierce oppositions, while being armed with nothing but tether-harpoons and your wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/12070cb14aac4c106b0865cd