tle environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn to counter various fleet elements, including attack ships, support crafts and logistic units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through 50+ pre-made waves, or face randomly generated fleets in endless mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clash with 16+ massive boss enemies and turn them into screen-filling explosions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge clearly telegraphed enemy attacks and potentially turn them against your opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid or exploit various hazards like flammable fuel spills, electrified hulls, coolant clouds and magnetic fields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/1b838f6b1c01b468e2da3c54a4db6670.poster.avif?t=1761726096\" width=600 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/1b838f6b1c01b468e2da3c54a4db6670.webm?t=1761726096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714080/extras/1b838f6b1c01b468e2da3c54a4db6670.mp4?t=1761726096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock 18+ player ship variants that offer distinct playstyles, advantages and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your craft with 120+ stackable ship and tether upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch and collect 14 bio-mechanical fish to gain advanced tech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 10+ star system zones and the new enemies they throw at you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the game's lore by finding black boxes among all the ship-debris.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a tiny glimpse at a complex sci-